OL,3,GNEWSABudget Fiat 500s complete 4,000km
OL,4,ARome challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of a challenge that saw
OL,7,Fa group of men drive #500 Fiat 500s
OL,8,Ffrom Heathrow to Rome said they felt an
OL,9,F"overwhelming sense of pride" on
OL,10,Freturning home having raised #13,000
OL,11,Ffor charity.
OL,13,FStuart Bailey, from Rusper, West
OL,14,FSussex, organised the 4,000km (2,485
OL,15,Fmile) trip for the Movember men's
OL,16,Fhealth charity, taking 27 people from
OL,17,FHeathrow to the Italian capital in
OL,18,Fthree days.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
