OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABudget Fiat 500s complete 4,000km
OL,4,ARome challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group, due to arrive in Newdigate,
OL,7,FSurrey, on Wednesday, took five months
OL,8,Fto prepare for the challenge, with all
OL,9,Feight cars making the trip in one
OL,10,Fpiece.
OL,12,FBailey said: "The cause is so
OL,13,Fimportant. Movember is genuinely making
OL,14,Fa difference to men's health, and we're
OL,15,Fstill fundraising to reach our #20,000
OL,16,Ftarget."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
